>**{c=red:If you have any other }{n:Borghertz's|Borghertz}{c=red: Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest!}**
=2 Walkthrough
Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with {n:Guslam} located at (H-8) in {z:Upper Jeuno} on {p:Red Mage} to begin the quest.
* Go to {z:The Eldieme Necropolis} and find a {p:Treasure Coffer}.
** {n:Churano-Shurano} {z:Windurst Waters} (F-8), you can purchase a Permanent Key Item: {k:Magicked astrolabe} for 10,000 Gil. This allows you to open doors in {z:The Eldieme Necropolis} solo.
* Either obtain a {i:Eldieme Coffer Key|Eldieme Coffer Key|1046} or pick the lock as a {p:Thief}. (Key is sold for 5,000 gil from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle} and {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"})

:* You do not need to be on Red Mage when opening the coffer.

* You will receive a {p:key item|Key Item} {k:Old gauntlets} from the coffer.
* Return to {z:Upper Jeuno} and speak to {n:Guslam}. He will inform you he is unable to repair the gauntlets.
* If this is your first Artifact gear set (AF) you must do the following, otherwise skip these steps:

:* Speak to {n:Deadly Minnow} inside of the Durable Shields shop.
:* Head to {z:Lower Jeuno} inside the Tenshodo area. Speak with {n:Yin Pocanakhu} at (J-8) and then trade 1,000 {p:Gil} to continue.

* Go to {z:Port Jeuno} and head down to the crates near the AH and Jeuno Duty-Free Shop at (H-8).
* Click on the **???** to receive a cutscene.
* Travel to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and go to (F-8) on the first map.
* Click on one of the torches to spawn {m:Dark Spark}.
* Once {m:Dark Spark} is defeated, examine one of the torches for the {p:Key Item} {k:Shadow flames}.
* Return to Port Jeuno and examine the **???** again. After the cutscene, the quest is complete.

=2 Two Additional Coffers
{n:Guslam} mentions that there is still armor scattered about Vana'diel. You can find two more pieces of armor by opening coffers in the following zones with the corresponding coffer key:
* {z:Garlaige Citadel} - {@i:Warlock's Tights|14218} {i:Warlock's Tights|Warlock's Tights|14218}
* {z:Castle Oztroja} - {@i:Warlock's Tabard|12642} {i:Warlock's Tabard|Warlock's Tabard|12642}
** These coffers are not required to complete the quest, therefore after you receive your hands the quest is "completed".
** The quest must either be active or completed in order to receive these attire pieces.
*** **Note (2026)**: This may no longer be accurate. I was able to open the coffers (on RDM) and receive the Warlock's Tights and Tabard without starting the Borghertz's Hands quest.
** You **must** have {p:Red Mage} as your main job when you open these coffers.
** 4 lever Brass Gate combination changes each Vanadiel day in Castle Oztroja
